  "title": "Better FPS (Modpack)",
  "description": "Utilizes the power of Vulkan API to give you the best performance boost, even on 10-year-old hardware.",
  "body": "<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gIAtGkZ.png\"/>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n[My Website](https://pandadev.net)\n\n<a href=\"https://buymeacoffee.com/pandadev_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Buy_Me_A_Coffee-FFDD00?style=for-the-badge&logo=buy-me-a-coffee&logoColor=black\"/></a>\n\n**Important: Since Vulkan is a fundamentally different graphics API, many mods will not work.**\n\n***\n\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LwvzhOP.png\" height=\"54px\"/>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\nThis modpack aims to run on every last potato hardware you can build a pc with. I personally tested this on an HP EliteBook i5-6600U and got stable 100 FPS, whereas Sodium would sit at 30-40 FPS.\n\n***\n\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pl8er1F.png\" height=\"54px\"/>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\nIf you have issues, join my [discord](https://discord.gg/Y7SbYphVw9). For people that want to add the own mods, [here](https://github.com/xCollateral/VulkanMod/issues/46) is a list of incompatible/compatible mods.\n\n***\n\nCheck out my other projects on [my profile](https://modrinth.com/user/PandaDEV)",
